meta {
  name: List products
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=0&size=20&sort=name_asc
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  page: 0
  size: 20
  sort: name_asc
  ~category: {{categoryId}}
  ~q: milk
}

docs {
  RUN.md sections 4, 5, 6 and 7. Expected 200. Enable category/q in Params to filter; modify this request for all sort/search/pagination checks. Sort: name_asc, name_desc, price_asc, price_desc. Page is zero-based; size clamps to 1–100. Invalid sort/parameter returns 400; unknown category returns 404.
}
